{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05225","headline":"行路难 · 张紘","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见温家玉镜台，提携抱屋九重来。\n君不见相如绿绮琴，一抚一拍凤凰音。\n人生意气须及早，莫负当年行乐心。\n荆王奏曲楚妃叹，曲尽欢终夜将半。\n朱楼银阁正平生，碧草青苔坐芜漫。\n当春对酒不须疑，视日相看能几时。\n春风吹尽燕初至，此时自爲称君意。\n秋露萎草鸿始归，此时衰暮与君违。\n人生翻覆何常定，谁保容颜无是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张紘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}